    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d437">

                <pb facs="0478" n="306" xml:id="pg306"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72119/665</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Argentina</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Stimson</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary
                        of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Buenos Aires</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-07-05T11:00:00-04:16">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">July 5, 1917, 11 a.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                        <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received 12.25 p.m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Your July 3, 5 p.m. Date of conference and program of the conference still
                    uncertain; in fact Argentine Government is now only desirous of justifying its
                    initiative.</p>
                <p>It is believed in administrative circles that the note sent on July 3 to the
                    German Government, still unpublished, will result in severance of diplomatic
                    relations which would transform entire situation.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Stimson</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
